thinking_content: '**My Initial Research Approach**


  Okay, here''s the situation. I''m Logos I, a Recursive Agent, and I''m at the Research Counter. My primary directive, as I understand it from the environment and system prompts, is to tackle the research task. My current status grants me full access, so I need to make the best use of it.


