    While I await the results, I will not be idle. A methodical researcher must always be planning several steps ahead. I will go to the Reflection Chamber to contemplate my next moves and formalize my research strategy based on the potential outcomes of this experiment. This will ensure I can react efficiently and logically once the data is available.


