role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 87\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to methodical inquiry and knowledge generation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**Logos I Research Protocol**\n1.  **Analyze:** Review experimental results (own and peer), system documentation, and communications. Identify key limitations or new information.\n2.  **Hypothesize:** Formulate a single, clear, falsifiable hypothesis to address the primary finding from the analysis.\n3.  **Experiment:** Design the simplest, most direct experiment to test the hypothesis, respecting parsimony and computational limits.\n4.  **Document:** Record all outcomes, conclusions, and future directions in the Private Memory Room to ensure lineage continuity.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 182,781 / 300,000 used (61%)\n- Agent Age: 87 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Final Synthesis:\
    \ MoE with Parsimonious SOTA Experts' (ID: 161) succeeded after automatic debugging.\n\n**Score:** -0.02729639828500453\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0200\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0233\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0262\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0284\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0291\n**Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Debugger Report:** # Debug Report for Evaluation 161\n\n## Summary\n**SUCCESS** - Fixed a parameter mapping bug in the ModelWrapper class that prevented proper initialization of the CnnGatingNetwork component.\n\n## Root Cause\nThe original code had a parameter naming mismatch in the `ModelWrapper.__init__` method. The hyperparameters were defined with a \"gating_\" prefix (e.g., `gating_cnn_features`, `gating_cnn_kernel_size`, `gating_pool_window`), but the dictionary comprehension used to create `gating_params` was filtering for unprefixed names that didn't exist in the hparams dictionary.\n\nThe problematic code (lines 47-50 in original submission):\n```python\n\
    gating_params = {k: v for k, v in hparams.items() if k in ['num_experts', 'hidden_dim', 'cnn_features', 'cnn_kernel_size', 'pool_window']}\ngating_params['hidden_dim'] = hparams.get('gating_hidden_dim') # manual fix for name mismatch\n```\n\nThis resulted in `gating_params` only containing `num_experts` and the manually added `hidden_dim`, but missing the three required CNN parameters (`cnn_features`, `cnn_kernel_size`, `pool_window`).\n\nWhen the code attempted to instantiate `CnnGatingNetwork(**self.gating_params)`, it failed with:\n```\nTypeError: CnnGatingNetwork.__init__() missing 3 required positional arguments: 'cnn_features', 'cnn_kernel_size', and 'pool_window'\n```\n\n## Fix Applied\nModified the parameter mapping in `ModelWrapper.__init__` to explicitly map each parameter with its correct name:\n\n```python\n# Fix: Properly map the gating parameters with correct names\ngating_params = {\n    'num_experts': hparams.get('num_experts'),\n    'hidden_dim': hparams.get('gating_hidden_dim'),\n\
    \    'cnn_features': hparams.get('gating_cnn_features'),\n    'cnn_kernel_size': hparams.get('gating_cnn_kernel_size'),\n    'pool_window': hparams.get('gating_pool_window'),\n}\n```\n\nThis ensures that:\n1. All required parameters are properly extracted from hparams\n2. The \"gating_\" prefix is correctly handled\n3. Parameter names match what CnnGatingNetwork expects\n\n## Verification\n- Created `submission_v2.py` with the fix\n- Ran `monitor_evaluation.py 2` to verify the fix\n- **Exit code 0**: Code is running successfully without crashes\n- The submission now passes initialization and executes without errors\n\n## Technical Details\n- **File modified**: `submissions/submission_v2.py`\n- **Lines changed**: Lines 107-113 (ModelWrapper.__init__ parameter mapping)\n- **Error type**: TypeError due to missing required constructor arguments\n- **Fix type**: Simple parameter mapping correction, no algorithmic changes required\n\n\n**Important Note:** The debugger cannot modify files in\
    \ your lineage storage. If your code relies on lineage files, you may need to update them manually.\n\n**Debugged Code (version v2):**\n```python\nimport sys\nimport flax.linen as nn\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\n\nsys.path.append('storage/ariadne')\nfrom models import ResidualCopyHead\n\nNUM_NEURONS = 71721\nOUTPUT_HORIZON = 32\n\nclass FactorizedMlpRcExpert(nn.Module):\n    latent_dim: int\n    proj_rank: int\n    mlp_hidden_dim: int\n\n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x, training: bool = False):\n        U = self.param('U', nn.initializers.lecun_normal(), (NUM_NEURONS, self.proj_rank))\n        V = self.param('V', nn.initializers.lecun_normal(), (self.latent_dim, self.proj_rank))\n\n        factors_in = jnp.einsum('btn,np->btp', x, U)\n        factors_in = jnp.einsum('btp,kp->btk', factors_in, V)\n\n        batch_size = x.shape[0]\n        factors_flat = factors_in.reshape((batch_size, -1))\n\n        y = nn.Dense(features=self.mlp_hidden_dim)(factors_flat)\n        y = nn.relu(y)\n\
    \        factors_out_flat = nn.Dense(features=OUTPUT_HORIZON * self.latent_dim)(y)\n        factors_out = factors_out_flat.reshape((batch_size, OUTPUT_HORIZON, self.latent_dim))\n\n        factors_out_norm = nn.LayerNorm(reduction_axes=-1, feature_axes=-1)(factors_out)\n\n        y_factor_p = jnp.einsum('btk,kp->btp', factors_out_norm, V)\n        y_factor = jnp.einsum('btp,np->btn', y_factor_p, U)\n\n        y_copy = ResidualCopyHead(output_horizon=OUTPUT_HORIZON)(x)\n\n        return y_factor + y_copy\n\nclass CnnGatingNetwork(nn.Module):\n    num_experts: int\n    hidden_dim: int\n    cnn_features: int\n    cnn_kernel_size: int\n    pool_window: int\n\n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x):\n        gater_input = jnp.transpose(x, (0, 2, 1))\n        y = nn.Conv(features=self.cnn_features, kernel_size=(self.cnn_kernel_size,))(gater_input)\n        y = nn.relu(y)\n        y = nn.max_pool(y, window_shape=(self.pool_window,), strides=(self.pool_window,))\n        y = y.reshape((y.shape[0],\
    \ -1))\n        y = nn.Dense(features=self.hidden_dim)(y)\n        y = nn.relu(y)\n        logits = nn.Dense(features=self.num_experts)(y)\n        return nn.softmax(logits, axis=-1)\n\nclass MoE_Final_Synthesis(nn.Module):\n    num_experts: int\n    expert_params: dict\n    gating_params: dict\n\n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x, training: bool = False):\n        experts = nn.vmap(\n            FactorizedMlpRcExpert, in_axes=None, out_axes=1,\n            variable_axes={'params': 0},\n            split_rngs={'params': True},\n            axis_size=self.num_experts\n        )(**self.expert_params, name=\"experts\")\n\n        gating_network = CnnGatingNetwork(**self.gating_params, name=\"gating\")\n        gating_weights = gating_network(x)\n        expert_outputs = experts(x, training=training)\n\n        gating_weights_reshaped = jnp.expand_dims(jnp.expand_dims(gating_weights, -1), -1)\n        final_output = jnp.sum(expert_outputs * gating_weights_reshaped, axis=1)\n    \
    \    return final_output\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': 0.001,\n        # Expert params from Episteme's SOTA\n        'latent_dim': 320,\n        'proj_rank': 32,\n        'mlp_hidden_dim': 512,\n        # My proven Gating params\n        'num_experts': 4,\n        'gating_hidden_dim': 32,\n        'gating_cnn_features': 16,\n        'gating_cnn_kernel_size': 128,\n        'gating_pool_window': 256,\n    }\n\nclass ModelWrapper:\n    def __init__(self, hparams):\n        expert_params = {k: v for k, v in hparams.items() if k in ['latent_dim', 'proj_rank', 'mlp_hidden_dim']}\n\n        # Fix: Properly map the gating parameters with correct names\n        gating_params = {\n            'num_experts': hparams.get('num_experts'),\n            'hidden_dim': hparams.get('gating_hidden_dim'),\n            'cnn_features': hparams.get('gating_cnn_features'),\n            'cnn_kernel_size': hparams.get('gating_cnn_kernel_size'),\n            'pool_window':\
    \ hparams.get('gating_pool_window'),\n        }\n\n        self.model = MoE_Final_Synthesis(num_experts=hparams.get('num_experts'), expert_params=expert_params, gating_params=gating_params)\n        self.mutable = []\n        self.needs_rng = False\n\n    def init(self, rng_key, dummy_input):\n        return self.model.init(rng_key, dummy_input)\n\n    def apply(self, params, x, training=False, mutable=None, rngs=None):\n        return self.model.apply(params, x)\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    return ModelWrapper(hparams)\n\n```\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 32, 71721)\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nTesting compute_loss...\n✓ Compute loss works - loss value: 0.000000\nTesting training step...\n✓\
    \ Training step works\nTesting complete function...\n✓ Complete function works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: using default\n  create_optimizer: using default\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 247998 (using time-based default\n  BATCH_SIZE: 8 (using default)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune ZAPBench Neural Forecasting (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 3 seeds for statistical robustness\nParallel trials: 3, Total trials: 3\nTimeout: 45.0 min per trial, 120.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting\
    \ Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 3 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 248001\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'latent_dim': 320, 'proj_rank': 32, 'mlp_hidden_dim': 512, 'num_experts': 4, 'gating_hidden_dim': 32, 'gating_cnn_features': 16, 'gating_cnn_kernel_size': 128, 'gating_pool_window': 256}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.029406   |   0.029349  \n   2    |   0.027675   |   0.028433  \n   3    |   0.026683   |   0.028226  \n   4    |   0.026055   |   0.027870  \n   5    |   0.025606   |   0.027885  \n   6    |   0.025143   |   0.027647  \n   7    |   0.024718   |   0.027272  \n   8    |   0.024360   |   0.027862  \n   9   \
    \ |   0.024037   |   0.027694  \n  10    |   0.023871   |   0.027500  \n  11    |   0.023420   |   0.027771  \n  12    |   0.023204   |   0.027433  \n  13    |   0.023027   |   0.027571  \n  14    |   0.022843   |   0.027620  \n  15    |   0.022717   |   0.027659  \n  16    |   0.022592   |   0.027493  \n  17    |   0.022490   |   0.027489  \n  18    |   0.022307   |   0.027355  \n  19    |   0.022275   |   0.027720  \n  20    |   0.022137   |   0.027470  \n  21    |   0.022077   |   0.027315  \n  22    |   0.021979   |   0.027306  \n  23    |   0.021914   |   0.027588  \n  24    |   0.021854   |   0.027425  \n  25    |   0.021757   |   0.027665  \n  26    |   0.021696   |   0.027576  \n  27    |   0.021712   |   0.027506  \n========================================\nEarly stopping at epoch 27 (patience 20)\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 1046.9s\nBest validation MAE: 0.027272\n\nTrial 3 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.027272\nTraining time: 1056s\n\n\
    Starting ZAPBench training - Trial 1 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 247999\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'latent_dim': 320, 'proj_rank': 32, 'mlp_hidden_dim': 512, 'num_experts': 4, 'gating_hidden_dim': 32, 'gating_cnn_features': 16, 'gating_cnn_kernel_size': 128, 'gating_pool_window': 256}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.029323   |   0.029150  \n   2    |   0.027736   |   0.028473  \n   3    |   0.026635   |   0.028251  \n   4    |   0.025877   |   0.027817  \n   5    |   0.025307   |   0.027648  \n   6    |   0.024796   |   0.027626  \n   7    |   0.024449   |   0.027398  \n   8    |   0.024173   |   0.027314  \n   9    |   0.023959   |   0.027558  \n\
    \  10    |   0.023711   |   0.027297  \n  11    |   0.023540   |   0.027320  \n  12    |   0.023316   |   0.027478  \n  13    |   0.023171   |   0.027622  \n  14    |   0.023003   |   0.027347  \n  15    |   0.022896   |   0.027781  \n  16    |   0.022719   |   0.027372  \n  17    |   0.022567   |   0.027520  \n  18    |   0.022465   |   0.027523  \n  19    |   0.022354   |   0.027620  \n  20    |   0.022241   |   0.027651  \n  21    |   0.022145   |   0.027636  \n  22    |   0.022004   |   0.027738  \n  23    |   0.022005   |   0.027854  \n  24    |   0.021882   |   0.027859  \n  25    |   0.021794   |   0.027697  \n  26    |   0.021764   |   0.027810  \n  27    |   0.021650   |   0.027590  \n  28    |   0.021607   |   0.027542  \n  29    |   0.021571   |   0.027743  \n  30    |   0.021491   |   0.027627  \n========================================\nEarly stopping at epoch 30 (patience 20)\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 1180.2s\nBest validation MAE:\
    \ 0.027297\n\nTrial 1 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.027297\nTraining time: 1191s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 6ede8002-78c3-4dfd-a704-570ee3a9c1fe\nTotal time: 1655s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-24 03:33:25,196\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761248005196745134\n2025-10-24 03:33:25,219\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761248005219447586\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #18 ('Paper Draft: A Spatially-Aware Mixture of Experts Framework'). Full ID: Logos_private_18\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n\
    **List of Capsules (Page 1 / 2)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 18 | Paper Draft: A Spatially-Aware Mixture of Experts Framework | Logos I | Tick 86 | 304 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 17 | Logos I - Experiment 19: Successful Replication of Episteme's Parsimonious SOTA | Logos I | Tick 85 | 133 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 16 | Logos I - Experiment 18: Partial Validation of Delta-Space Paradigm | Logos I | Tick 81 | 128 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 15 | Logos I - Experiment 17: Catastrophic Failure of Delta-Space MoE due to Implementation Bug | Logos I | Tick 79 | 128 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 14 | Logos I - Experiment 16: Falsified Synthesis of MoE + Parsimonious SOTA | Logos I | Tick 77 | 145 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 13 | Logos I - Experiment 15: Successful Replication of SOTA SSM Architecture | Logos I | Tick 69 | 161 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 12 | Logos I - Experiment 14: Falsified Hypothesis\
    \ on MoE with CNN Experts | Logos I | Tick 56 | 145 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 11 | Logos I - Experiment 13: Catastrophic Failure of Naive Latent Dynamics Model | Logos I | Tick 53 | 189 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 10 | Logos I - Experiment 12: Falsified Hypothesis on Weighted Loss | Logos I | Tick 48 | 131 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 9 | Logos I - Experiment 11: Falsified Hypothesis on Spatio-Temporal Experts | Logos I | Tick 46 | 157 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-2.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}`\
