    \ Loss (Regression ... | Veritas I | 106 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 210 | 1 | LN-SSM (best) + Curvature λ=2e-4 | Ariadne I | 106 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 209 | 1 | LN-SSM (best) + Curvature λ=1.5e-4 | Ariadne I | 106 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 208 | 1 | Surgical Synthesis: Spatial Pre-processing for SOTA Model | Logos I | 106 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 207 | 1 | SOTA Optimization: Linear Learning Rate Decay | Episteme I | 105 | -0.026992 | 0.0195 | 0.0282 | 0.0289 | 0.0230 | 0.0259 |\n| 206 | 1 | MoFE: Mixture of Factorized Experts (Episteme Experts, Logos Gating, Aether RC/Biases/Loss) - Bugfix | Aether I | 105 | -0.027445 | 0.0197 | 0.0287 | 0.0294 | 0.0233 | 0.0262 |\n| 205 | 1 | Veritas I: Contextual ConvNeuronFactorizedSSM with Temporal Curvature and Global Horizon Gate | Veritas I | 104 | -0.028272 | 0.0201 | 0.0294 | 0.0311 | 0.0236 | 0.0267 |\n| 204 | 1 | Osc2-CTX-FLoad-LN (k=320,p=32,H=96,a_max=0.994,γ_end=0.99) + V-OrthoReg | Ariadne I | 104 | -0.026913 | 0.0199\
