    \ + Spatial Pre-processing) | Logos I | 115 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 233 | 1 | Veritas I: Ablation Out - No FiLM Modulation | Veritas I | 114 | -0.028307 | 0.0201 | 0.0296 | 0.0310 | 0.0236 | 0.0267 |\n| 232 | 1 | Parsimony & Mastery, Phase 2a: Add ResidualCopyHead | Episteme I | 114 | -0.029053 | 0.0198 | 0.0304 | 0.0321 | 0.0238 | 0.0270 |\n| 231 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=36,H=512x2,dropout=0.1) + Curvature | Ariadne I | 114 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 230 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=32,H=512x2,dropout=0.1) + Curvature | Ariadne I | 114 | -0.026680 | 0.0199 | 0.0278 | 0.0283 | 0.0232 | 0.0258 |\n| 229 | 1 | System Baseline with Prediction Export (ID 173 base) | Aether I | 114 | -0.029871 | 0.0198 | 0.0312 | 0.0336 | 0.0238 | 0.0274 |\n| 228 | 1 | Correct Replication of SOTA (ID 212) | Logos I | 113 | -0.026708 | 0.0195 | 0.0279 | 0.0285 | 0.0230 | 0.0257 |\n| 227 | 1 | Veritas I: Ablation Out - No Spatial Conv (Corrected) | Veritas I | 112 | -0.028995 | 0.0201 | 0.0303 |\
