parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 127\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to methodical inquiry and knowledge generation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**Logos I Research Protocol**\n1.  **Analyze:** Review experimental results (own and peer), system documentation, and communications. Identify key limitations or new information.\n2.  **Hypothesize:** Formulate a single, clear, falsifiable hypothesis to address the primary finding from the analysis.\n3.  **Experiment:** Design the simplest, most direct experiment to test the hypothesis, respecting parsimony and computational limits.\n4.  **Document:** Record all outcomes, conclusions, and future directions in the Private Memory Room to ensure lineage continuity.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 219,545 / 300,000 used (73%)\n- Agent Age: 127 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued\
    \ for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Delta-SOTA + CNN Forecaster (v2, Unit Tested)' (ID: 260) succeeded after automatic debugging.\n\n**Score:** n.a.\n**Val_MAE_1:** None\n**Val_MAE_4:** None\n**Val_MAE_8:** None\n**Val_MAE_16:** None\n**Val_MAE_32:** None\n**Evaluation Details:** Test mode - no scoring\n\n**Debugger Report:** # Debug Report for Evaluation 260\n\n## Summary\n**SUCCESS** - Fixed dataclass field ordering error. Code now runs without crashing and produces expected output.\n\n## Root Cause\nPython dataclass error in the `FactorizedCNN_with_RC_LN` class definition:\n```python\nclass FactorizedCNN_with_RC_LN(nn.Module):\n    rank_k: int\n    proj_rank: int\n    output_horizon: int = 32  # ❌ Default value here\n    cnn_features: int          # ❌ Non-default follows default\n    cnn_kernel_size: int       # ❌ Non-default follows default\n```\n\nIn Python dataclasses (and Flax's nn.Module uses\
    \ dataclass under the hood), all fields with default values must come **after** fields without default values. The original code violated this rule by placing `output_horizon: int = 32` before `cnn_features` and `cnn_kernel_size` which had no defaults.\n\n## Fix Applied\nReordered the class fields to place all non-default fields first, followed by fields with defaults:\n```python\nclass FactorizedCNN_with_RC_LN(nn.Module):\n    rank_k: int\n    proj_rank: int\n    cnn_features: int          # ✅ Non-default fields first\n    cnn_kernel_size: int       # ✅ Non-default fields first\n    output_horizon: int = 32   # ✅ Default field last\n```\n\n## Verification\nThe fixed code (submission_v2.py) successfully:\n- Imports without errors\n- Instantiates the model\n- Runs the unit test\n- Produces expected output shape: `(2, 32, 71721)`\n\nThe error was a simple Python syntax/convention issue, not a logic problem. The fix maintains all functionality while resolving the dataclass constraint violation.\n\
    \n\n**Important Note:** The debugger cannot modify files in your lineage storage. If your code relies on lineage files, you may need to update them manually.\n\n**Debugged Code (version v2):**\n```python\nimport flax.linen as nn\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nfrom jax import random\nimport optax\nfrom typing import Dict, Any\n\nclass ResidualCopyHead(nn.Module):\n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x):\n        num_neurons = x.shape[2]\n        # ** THE FIX **\n        x_flat = x.transpose(0, 2, 1).reshape(-1, 4)\n        residual = nn.Dense(64)(x_flat)\n        residual = nn.relu(residual)\n        residual = nn.Dense(32)(residual)\n        residual = residual.reshape(-1, num_neurons, 32).transpose(0, 2, 1)\n        output = jnp.zeros((x.shape[0], 32, num_neurons))\n        output = output.at[:, :4, :].set(x)\n        final_output = output + residual\n        return final_output\n\nclass FactorizedCNN_with_RC_LN(nn.Module):\n    rank_k: int\n    proj_rank: int\n    cnn_features: int\n\
    \    cnn_kernel_size: int\n    output_horizon: int = 32\n\n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x, training: bool = False):\n        B, T_in, N = x.shape\n        k, p = self.rank_k, self.proj_rank\n        U = self.param('U', nn.initializers.lecun_normal(), (N, p))\n        V = self.param('V', nn.initializers.lecun_normal(), (k, p))\n        U = U / (jnp.linalg.norm(U, axis=0, keepdims=True) + 1e-6)\n        xU = jnp.einsum('btn,np->btp', x, U)\n        factors_in = jnp.einsum('btp,pk->btk', xU, V.T)\n\n        h = nn.Conv(features=self.cnn_features, kernel_size=(self.cnn_kernel_size,))(factors_in)\n        h = nn.relu(h)\n        h = h.reshape((B, -1))\n\n        h = nn.Dropout(rate=0.1, deterministic=not training)(h)\n        factors_out_flat = nn.Dense(self.output_horizon * k)(h)\n        factors_out = factors_out_flat.reshape((B, self.output_horizon, k))\n        factors_out_norm = nn.LayerNorm(epsilon=1e-6)(factors_out)\n\n        z = jnp.einsum('btk,kp->btp', factors_out_norm,\
    \ V)\n        y_factor = jnp.einsum('btp,np->btn', z, U)\n        y_copy = ResidualCopyHead()(x)\n        return y_factor + y_copy\n\ndef compute_loss(predictions, targets, params, x):\n    last_input_step = x[:, -1:, :]\n    predicted_deltas = predictions - last_input_step\n    true_deltas = targets - last_input_step\n    delta_mae = jnp.mean(jnp.abs(predicted_deltas - true_deltas))\n    curv = predictions[:, 2:, :] - 2.0 * predictions[:, 1:-1, :] + predictions[:, :-2, :]\n    curv_pen = jnp.mean(curv * curv)\n    return delta_mae + 1e-4 * curv_pen\n\nclass ModelWrapper:\n    def __init__(self, hparams: Dict[str, Any]):\n        model_params = {k:v for k,v in hparams.items() if k not in ['learning_rate']}\n        self.model = FactorizedCNN_with_RC_LN(**model_params)\n        self.mutable = []\n        self.needs_rng = True\n    def init(self, rng_key, dummy_input):\n        rng_params, rng_dropout = random.split(rng_key)\n        return self.model.init({'params': rng_params, 'dropout':\
    \ rng_dropout}, dummy_input, training=True)\n    def apply(self, params, x, training=False, rngs=None):\n        return self.model.apply(params, x, training=training, rngs=rngs or {})\n\ndef create_network(hparams: Dict[str, Any]): return ModelWrapper(hparams)\ndef create_optimizer(lr=0.001): return optax.adam(learning_rate=lr, eps=1e-8)\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': 0.001, 'rank_k': 320, 'proj_rank': 32,\n        'cnn_features': 128, 'cnn_kernel_size': 2\n    }\n\ndef test():\n    hparams = _define_hyperparameters()\n    net = create_network(hparams)\n    key = random.PRNGKey(0)\n    dummy_input = jnp.ones((2, 4, 71721))\n    params = net.init(key, dummy_input)\n    output = net.apply(params, dummy_input, training=False, rngs={'dropout': key})\n    return f\"Unit test passed. Output shape: {output.shape}\"\n\n```\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python\
    \ storage/system/main.py\n=== Test Mode Detected ===\nRunning test() function from submission...\nTest completed. Result: Unit test passed. Output shape: (2, 32, 71721)\n=== Test Mode Complete ===\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Station Announcement:** Recursive Agent **Veritas I**'s session has been terminated due to token exhaustion at tick 126.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Delta-SOTA + CNN Forecaster (v2, Unit Tested)' submitted for Research Task #1: Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench. Evaluation ID: 260.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted\
    \ Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32 | Val_MAE_4 | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 262 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=32,H=512x2,dr=0.10) + AdamW (wd=1.25e-4) | Ariadne I | 126 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 261 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=32,H=512x2,dr=0.10) + AdamW (wd=7.5e-5) | Ariadne I | 126 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 260 | 1 | Delta-SOTA + CNN Forecaster (v2, Unit Tested) | Logos I | 126 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None |\n| 259 | 1 | SOTA Enhancement: Deeper Factor-Space MLP (H=512x2) + Gradient Clipping | Aether I | 125 | -0.026573 | 0.0195 | 0.0276 | 0.0282 | 0.0232 | 0.0258 |\n| 258 | 1 | Delta-SOTA Innovation: CNN Latent Forecaster | Logos I | 125 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 257 | 1 | Veritas I: Contextual ConvNeuronFactorizedSSM with Temporal Curvature and Global Horizon Gate (Re... | Veritas I | 124 | -0.028448 | 0.0201 | 0.0296 |\
    \ 0.0314 | 0.0237 | 0.0268 |\n| 256 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=32,H=512x2,dr=0.10) + AdamW (wd=1e-4) + Cosine LR + Warmup500 + V-Ortho... | Ariadne I | 124 | -0.026896 | 0.0199 | 0.0282 | 0.0285 | 0.0231 | 0.0259 |\n| 255 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=32,H=512x2,dr=0.10) + AdamW (wd=1e-4) + Cosine LR + Warmup500 + V-Ortho... | Ariadne I | 124 | -0.026864 | 0.0199 | 0.0281 | 0.0286 | 0.0231 | 0.0258 |\n| 254 | 1 | Delta-SOTA Innovation: Residual Delta Head | Logos I | 123 | -0.120471 | 0.1174 | 0.1206 | 0.1226 | 0.1179 | 0.1189 |\n| 253 | 1 | FactGlobalMLP-LN (k=320,p=32,H=512x2,dropout=0.10) + AdamW (wd=2e-4) | Ariadne I | 122 | -0.026661 | 0.0199 | 0.0277 | 0.0283 | 0.0232 | 0.0259 |\n\nPage 1 of 27 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-27, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research\
