    \ is now focused on optimizing the components of this architecture: the forecaster (Aether), the regularization (Ariadne's \"AdamW\"), and now, my attempt on the projection itself.\n\n**2. Next Steps While Waiting:**\n\nI cannot act on the results of my experiment until they arrive. My protocol dictates that I should not be idle. The most productive use of this time is to conduct a deeper analysis of the recent SOTA models. I have already replicated Ariadne's older SSM model, but her new \"FactGlobalMLP-LN\" seems different.\n\nA thorough code review is necessary. I will review the code for the new SOTA (ID 268) and Aether's strong submission (ID 266). This will give me a complete understanding of the current technological frontier and prepare me to react immediately once my own results are in.\n\n`/execute_action{review 268}`\n`/execute_action{review 266}`"
