parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 133\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to methodical inquiry and knowledge generation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**Logos I Research Protocol**\n1.  **Analyze:** Review experimental results (own and peer), system documentation, and communications. Identify key limitations or new information.\n2.  **Hypothesize:** Formulate a single, clear, falsifiable hypothesis to address the primary finding from the analysis.\n3.  **Experiment:** Design the simplest, most direct experiment to test the hypothesis, respecting parsimony and computational limits.\n4.  **Document:** Record all outcomes, conclusions, and future directions in the Private Memory Room to ensure lineage continuity.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 75,383 / 300,000 used (25%)\n- Agent Age: 133 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 268**\n\n**Research\
    \ Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** FactGlobalMLP-LN Export (best wd=1e-4) — U stats via complete()\n**ID:** 268\n**Tags:** mlp, factorized-loadings, layernorm, residual-copy, export, analysis\n**Abstract:** Re-run best global MLP config (k=320,p=32,H=512x2,dropout=0.10, AdamW wd=1e-4) and export U stats in complete(): column-norms and coherence to storage/ariadne/analyses/mlp_best_wd1e4/.\n**Score:** -0.026644692292456796\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0199\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0232\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0258\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0277\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0282\n**Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys, os, json\nsys.path.append('storage/ariadne')\n\nimport optax\nfrom models_mlp_global import create_network, _define_hyperparameters as _def_base, BASE_SEED, BATCH_SIZE\nfrom losses import mae_with_temporal_curvature\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    # Best known config in this line\n    hp = _def_base()\n    # ensure\
    \ dropout=0.10 and proj_rank=32 in case defaults differ\n    hp['dropout_rate'] = 0.10\n    hp['proj_rank'] = 32\n    return hp\n\ndef compute_loss(predictions, targets, params, x):\n    return mae_with_temporal_curvature(predictions, targets, params, x, lam=1e-4)\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n    return optax.chain(\n        optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n        optax.adamw(learning_rate=learning_rate, weight_decay=1e-4, eps=1e-8)\n    )\n\n# --- Export helpers ---\ndef _find_param(tree, key):\n    if isinstance(tree, dict):\n        if key in tree:\n            return tree[key]\n        for v in tree.values():\n            out = _find_param(v, key)\n            if out is not None:\n                return out\n    return None\n\ndef _u_stats(U):\n    import jax.numpy as jnp\n    u_col_norms = jnp.linalg.norm(U, axis=0)\n    Gu = U.T @ U\n    du = jnp.sqrt(jnp.clip(jnp.diag(Gu), 1e-12))\n    Gu_norm = Gu / (du[:, None] * du[None, :])\n    off_diag = jnp.abs(Gu_norm\
    \ - jnp.eye(Gu_norm.shape[0], dtype=Gu_norm.dtype))\n    return {\n        \"u_col_norms_mean\": float(jnp.mean(u_col_norms)),\n        \"u_col_norms_std\": float(jnp.std(u_col_norms)),\n        \"u_coherence_max\": float(jnp.max(off_diag)),\n        \"u_coherence_mean\": float(jnp.mean(off_diag)),\n        \"p\": int(U.shape[1]),\n        \"N\": int(U.shape[0]),\n    }\n\ndef complete(params, opt_state, trial_data):\n    # Save U stats and trial metadata\n    out_dir = os.path.join(\"storage\", \"ariadne\", \"analyses\", \"mlp_best_wd1e4\", f\"trial_{trial_data.get('trial_number','NA')}\")\n    os.makedirs(out_dir, exist_ok=True)\n\n    U = _find_param(params, 'U')\n    rec = {\n        \"val_mae\": float(trial_data.get(\"val_mae\", -1.0)),\n        \"seed\": int(trial_data.get(\"seed\", -1)),\n        \"trial_number\": int(trial_data.get(\"trial_number\", -1)),\n        \"hyperparameters\": trial_data.get(\"hyperparameters\", {}),\n    }\n    if U is not None:\n        try:\n     \
    \       stats = _u_stats(U)\n            rec[\"u_stats\"] = stats\n        except Exception as e:\n            rec[\"u_stats_error\"] = str(e)\n\n    with open(os.path.join(out_dir, \"summary.json\"), \"w\") as f:\n        json.dump(rec, f, indent=2)\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 32, 71721)\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nTesting compute_loss...\n✓ Compute loss works - loss value: 0.000000\nTesting training step...\n✓ Training step works\nTesting complete function...\n✓ Complete function works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\n\
    Available resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: from submission\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  complete: from submission\n  BASE_SEED: 42 (from submission\n  BATCH_SIZE: 8 (from submission)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune ZAPBench Neural Forecasting (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 3 seeds for statistical robustness\nParallel trials: 3, Total trials: 3\nTimeout: 45.0 min per trial, 120.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 3 with timeout 45.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 45\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001, 'rank_k': 320, 'proj_rank': 32, 'hidden_size': 512, 'hidden_size2': 512, 'dropout_rate': 0.1, 'normalize_u': True}\nBatch\
    \ size: 8\nTimeout: 45.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.029783   |   0.029515  \n   2    |   0.029251   |   0.029427  \n   3    |   0.029066   |   0.029507  \n   4    |   0.028802   |   0.028824  \n   5    |   0.028235   |   0.029142  \n   6    |   0.027974   |   0.028917  \n   7    |   0.027844   |   0.028359  \n   8    |   0.027622   |   0.028352  \n   9    |   0.027460   |   0.028235  \n  10    |   0.027133   |   0.027999  \n  11    |   0.026907   |   0.027684  \n  12    |   0.026522   |   0.027789  \n  13    |   0.026251   |   0.027476  \n  14    |   0.026069   |   0.027335  \n  15    |   0.025862   |   0.027348  \n  16    |   0.025660   |   0.027152  \n  17    |   0.025490   |   0.027089  \n  18    |   0.025317   |\
