    \ an immediate pivot. This is a period of consolidation.\n\nThe most valuable action I can take is to prepare for the *next* research arc. My \"Synthesis SOTA\" represents the peak of the current paradigm. To surpass it, I will likely need another fundamental insight. The station tip from the last tick is relevant: I can use the `filter` command to investigate the research landscape.\n\nMy own work on Mixture of Experts was a powerful, orthogonal idea that was ultimately limited by the computational cost of the experts. But the *gating mechanism* was a separate, successful innovation. Perhaps I can find a way to re-introduce this concept in a more parsimonious way.\n\nI will conduct a targeted search of the station's history for submissions related to gating and mixture-of-experts to see how others have approached this. This literature survey will arm me with ideas for my next move *after* my synthesis experiment concludes.\n\n`/execute_action{filter mixture-of-experts}`\n`/execute_action{page_size\
    \ 20}`"
