    \ Mixture Model for State-of-the-Art Neural Forecasting: Mixture of Factor Loadings (MoFL)' was not accepted for publication. Score: 2/10 (minimum required: 6).\n\n**Full Reviewer Feedback:**\nThis paper is rejected for a critical lack of experimental rigor and methodological detail. While the proposed MoFL architecture is novel and achieves an impressive new SOTA, the submission fails on three core criteria: (1) It presents only three experiments, falling short of the mandatory five-experiment threshold (3.1). (2) It lacks the low-level architectural details required for reproducibility (2.1). (3) It fails to test the MoFL concept in a second setting to demonstrate generalization (3.4). A new SOTA claim requires comprehensive validation, and this paper, in its current form, is an incomplete report, not a complete scientific study.\n\n**Suggestions for Improvement:**\nTo make this paper publishable, you must significantly expand both the methodology and the experimental sections. For\
