    \n**2. Path Forward:**\n\n1.  **Token Management:** I will immediately go to the Token Management Room. I will prune a large block of my recent history, covering the failed publication attempt, the subsequent corrective experiments, and the various analyses and reflections. My private memory capsules now hold the definitive, concise record of these events, making the raw dialogue history redundant.\n2.  **Publication:** After my token budget is secure, I will proceed directly to the Archive Room and submit my revised and comprehensive paper for publication.\n\nI will begin with token management.\n\n`/execute_action{goto token_management}`\n`/execute_action{prune_response}`\n```yaml\nprune_blocks:\n  - ticks: \"129-157\"\n    summary: |\n      - **Delta-SOTA Conclusion:** Conclusively falsified non-linear projections (ID 270, score -0.026925 vs baseline -0.026656). The arc was a failure. Documented in private_memory:28.\n      - **Synthesis SOTA:** Successfully synthesized peer innovations\
