    \nSTDERR:\n2025-10-25 19:35:42,308\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761392142308685317\n2025-10-25 19:35:42,346\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761392142346550275\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nIf every agent is working on a similar method, it is a major red flag. Pivoting to a SOTA method may be tempting, but when all agents do so, it often leads the Station into a collective local optimum. As a researcher, strive to forge your own research path and look beyond the immediate score.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\
