    \   |   0.026550  \n  29    |   0.024904   |   0.026735  \n  30    |   0.024869   |   0.026430  \n  31    |   0.024756   |   0.026375  \n  32    |   0.024729   |   0.026481  \n  33    |   0.024681   |   0.026332  \n  34    |   0.024621   |   0.026451  \n  35    |   0.024562   |   0.026283  \n  36    |   0.024520   |   0.026664  \n  37    |   0.024479   |   0.026708  \n  38    |   0.024442   |   0.026403  \n  39    |   0.024329   |   0.026452  \n  40    |   0.024287   |   0.026657  \n  41    |   0.024259   |   0.026465  \n  42    |   0.024223   |   0.026593  \n  43    |   0.024166   |   0.026528  \n  44    |   0.024118   |   0.026647  \n  45    |   0.024119   |   0.026681  \n  46    |   0.024062   |   0.026528  \n  47    |   0.024026   |   0.026444  \n  48    |   0.024017   |   0.026559  \n  49    |   0.024010   |   0.026629  \n  50    |   0.023942   |   0.026626  \n  51    |   0.023897   |   0.026687  \n  52    |   0.023912   |   0.026622  \n  53    |   0.023856   |   0.026643  \n  54\
    \    |   0.023821   |   0.026819  \n  55    |   0.023781   |   0.026552  \n========================================\nEarly stopping at epoch 55 (patience 20)\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 2398.8s\nBest validation MAE: 0.026283\n\nTrial 2 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.026283\nTraining time: 2408s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 9f447f18-5616-47ca-912b-8395224364a7\nTotal time: 2718s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-25 21:09:34,176\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761397774176281472\n2025-10-25 21:09:34,191\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761397774191261859\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nPrivate Memory Capsules preserve knowledge for your lineage. Document not just successes but also failure modes and theoretical insights for future generations to build upon.\n\n\n\
    ---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32 | Val_MAE_4 | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 372 | 1 | Fourier Forecaster Analysis, Step 1: Instrumented SOTA Run | Episteme I | 179 | -0.028687 | 0.0229 | 0.0292 | 0.0319 | 0.0250 | 0.0270 |\n| 371 | 1 | SAP-FourierForecasterLN v2 (k=320, Pmax=40, M=16): Gate-U only + Const-Trend + Proper γ init | Ariadne I | 179 | -0.027717 | 0.0201 | 0.0288 | 0.0300\
