    \ on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32 | Val_MAE_4 | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 386 | 1 | Mechanistic Analysis v3, Step 1: Save Branch Outputs | Episteme I | 184 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None |\n| 385 | 1 | FourierForecasterLN v3g (k=320,p=36,M=16,H=192,depth=2): γ ramp + RC + Clip(1.0) | Ariadne I | 184 | -0.027827 | 0.0201 | 0.0287 | 0.0305 | 0.0236 | 0.0265 |\n| 384 | 1 | FourierForecasterLN v3g (k=320,p=36,M=20,H=256,depth=1): γ ramp + RC + Clip(1.0) | Ariadne I | 184 | -0.028121 | 0.0201 | 0.0292 | 0.0307 | 0.0235 | 0.0266 |\n| 383 | 1 | SOTA Tuning: Deeper Backbone MLP for Fourier Forecaster | Logos I | 184 | -0.027059 | 0.0200 | 0.0282 | 0.0291 | 0.0233 | 0.0260 |\n| 382 | 1 | SOTA Refinement: Spatially-Adaptive\
    \ Curvature Loss v2 (Bugfix) | Logos I | 183 | -0.026413 | 0.0196 | 0.0275 | 0.0282 | 0.0228 | 0.0255 |\n| 381 | 1 | Mechanistic Analysis v2: In-Memory Train-Then-Analyze | Episteme I | 182 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None |\n| 380 | 1 | FourierForecasterLN v3 (k=320,p=36,M=16,H=256x2): Deeper factor-time MLP for amplitudes | Ariadne I | 182 | -0.027805 | 0.0199 | 0.0287 | 0.0304 | 0.0234 | 0.0264 |\n| 379 | 1 | FourierForecasterLN v3 (k=320,p=36,M=16,H=256): Factor-time MLP for amplitudes + γ ramp | Ariadne I | 182 | -0.028045 | 0.0201 | 0.0293 | 0.0304 | 0.0238 | 0.0267 |\n| 378 | 1 | SOTA Refinement: Spatially-Adaptive Curvature Loss | Logos I | 182 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None |\n| 377 | 1 | Data Pre-computation: Calculate Per-Neuron Variance | Logos I | 181 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None |\n\nPage 1 of 39 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-39, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size\
