    \ Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** FF-LN ScalarRamp (p=36,H=128,drop=0.05) + Clip(1.0), lr=9e-4\n**ID:** 404\n**Tags:** fourier, layernorm, factorized-loadings, scalar-ramp, residual-copy, replication\n**Abstract:** Same as the lr=1e-3 ScalarRamp but with a slightly lower Adam lr=9e-4 to test stability. Exports γ profile and U/V stats in complete().\n**Score:** -0.026287822742699474\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0194\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0229\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0254\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0272\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0283\n**Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys, optax\nsys.path.append('storage/ariadne')\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nfrom models_fourier_ramp import create_network, export_stats\n\nBASE_SEED = 42\nBATCH_SIZE = 8\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': 9e-4,\n        'rank_k': 320,\n        'proj_rank': 36,\n        'hidden_size': 128,\n        'drop': 0.05,\n        'gamma_start':\
