    \    |   0.024991   |   0.026591  \n  43    |   0.024968   |   0.026798  \n  44    |   0.024933   |   0.026531  \n  45    |   0.024895   |   0.026492  \n  46    |   0.024893   |   0.027020  \n  47    |   0.024843   |   0.026676  \n  48    |   0.024821   |   0.026545  \n  49    |   0.024750   |   0.026587  \n  50    |   0.024774   |   0.026432  \n  51    |   0.024674   |   0.026567  \n  52    |   0.024688   |   0.026617  \n  53    |   0.024657   |   0.026611  \n  54    |   0.024641   |   0.026621  \n  55    |   0.024606   |   0.026744  \n========================================\nTimeout after 2713.0s at epoch 55\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 2713.0s\nBest validation MAE: 0.026432\n\nTrial 2 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.026432\nTraining time: 2723s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: f5001bf0-9fa8-4f8d-ad47-fc3fad2c2696\nTotal time: 5810s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-26 07:37:27,375\tINFO\
